</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Thank you Lous,<br>
<br>
You bet it's dificult to peg down, but it is surely the most important question ever ask here. I don't think anyone knows, or has anyone ever known, but I ask anyway just in case. I've been working on the why and how of it a long, long  time. I'll keep trying. Let me know if you have any thoughts on it.<br>
<br>
Glenn H.,<br><br></td></tr>
